# Paths the update lane must NEVER put in the public cache, whatever else is
# true: regexes matched against the store path's name (after "<hash>-").
# A machine that needs one builds or fetches it itself, as before.
#
# Rule for adding a line: the licence does not let us redistribute it
# (nixpkgs: meta.license.free = false AND redistributable = false), or it
# holds something private. Redistributable unfree (nvidia_x11, broadcom-sta:
# lib.licenses.unfreeRedistributable) is allowed.

# Apple's FaceTime HD ISP firmware and its sensor calibration, cut out of
# Apple's driver downloads at build time (both licenses.unfree). Each Mac
# extracts them itself, in seconds.
^facetimehd-firmware
^facetimehd-calibration
